  "install_command": {
    "summary": "A package or tool install at the command position before it: a package manager with an install verb (brew, apt, pip, npm, bun, gem, go, cargo, uv, mise and more), npx-style fetch-and-run, nix, docker pull/run, Install-Module, dpkg -i, rpm -i/-U, n lts, the shared pydeps.py installer, and curl, wget or aria2c only when the download lands on disk or feeds something other than a text reader. Follow command_position_multishell with it; Bash tool input_match only.",
